# ─── Secrets & environment (NEVER commit these) ───
# Real API keys, OAuth secrets, DB connection strings live in .env files.
# Committing one leaks it forever in git history. .env.example (a template
# with placeholder values) is safe to commit — hence the exception below.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ─── Python / backend ───
backend/.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ─── Node / frontend ───
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/

# ─── Vercel ───
.vercel/

# ─── OS / editor cruft ───
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
